  "ui.MapPage.027": { zh: "按物品本身估价（不随市场浮动）计算：每小时循环数 × 每循环产量 × 加权估价", en: "Figured from each item's own valuation (it does not follow the market): cycles per hour × yield per cycle × weighted value" },
