  "ui.MarketPage.023": { zh: "自己的库存：物品 → 物品仓库、装备 → 装备库、蓝图 → 图书存量、AI 核心 → 核心库、舰船 → 舰船仓库 ＋ 在役舰队同型艘数（挂单托管中的不计）；舰船出售在舰船页「舰船仓库」操作", en: "Your own stock: items to the warehouse, modules to Module Storage, blueprints to book stock, AI cores to the core library, ships to Ship Storage plus same-hull counts in the active fleet (escrowed listings excluded); ships are sold from Ship Storage on the Ships page" },
