  "ui.MatterTechTab.004": { zh: "「虫洞谜质」：洞内撤离成功带回的研究材料，只收不卖", en: "Wormhole Enigma: research material carried back by a successful wormhole extraction; bought, never sold" },
  "ui.MatterTechTab.005": { zh: "虫洞谜质", en: "Wormhole Enigma" },
  "ui.MatterTechTab.006": { zh: "枚", en: "units" },
  "ui.MatterTechTab.007": { zh: "已点 {n}/{total} 级", en: "{n}/{total} levels researched" },
  "ui.MatterTechTab.008": { zh: "研究不消耗时间，点即生效", en: "Research takes no time and applies the moment you click" },
  "ui.MatterTechTab.009": { zh: "研究花费「虫洞谜质」与信用点，不消耗时间；效果一律即时生效。三条线分别作用于洞内探索（回合 / 采集 / 扫描 / 倍速）、洞内战斗（护盾装甲 / 命中回避 / 射程装填 / 威胁压制）与洞外工业（货柜拆解 / 虚空精炼 / 残骸解析）。部分节点有前置要求，需先点满前置的指定级数。", en: "Research costs Wormhole Enigma and credits, takes no time, and every effect applies at once. The three branches cover exploration inside the wormhole (turns, extraction, scanning, speed), combat inside it (shields and armor, accuracy and evasion, range and reload, threat suppression) and industry outside (container breakdown, void refining, wreck analysis). Some nodes have prerequisites, which have to be brought up to the required levels first." },
